## 📐 AppStyles - Centralized Design Constants

**ALWAYS use `AppStyles` for spacing, sizes, and responsive checks:**

```dart
import 'package:learn/core/theme/app_styles.dart';

// ===== SPACING =====
AppStyles.spacingMicro      // 4px - icon to text
AppStyles.spacingSmall      // 8px - small gaps
AppStyles.spacingDefault    // 12px - standard spacing
AppStyles.spacingMedium     // 16px - card padding
AppStyles.spacingLarge      // 20px - large padding
AppStyles.spacingSection    // 24px - section spacing

// ===== BORDER RADIUS =====
AppStyles.radiusCard        // 12px - cards
AppStyles.radiusChip        // 17px - chips/pills
AppStyles.radiusSheet       // 20px - bottom sheets

// ===== ICON SIZES =====
AppStyles.iconSmall         // 14px - buttons/chips
AppStyles.iconMedium        // 18px - badges
AppStyles.iconLarge         // 24px - headers

// ===== VERTICAL BAR =====
AppStyles.barWidth          // 3px
AppStyles.barHeight         // 44px
AppStyles.barRadius         // 2px

// ===== RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS =====
AppStyles.breakpointMobile     // 600px
AppStyles.breakpointTablet     // 900px
AppStyles.breakpointDesktop    // 1200px
AppStyles.breakpointLarge      // 1600px

// ===== RESPONSIVE HELPERS =====
AppStyles.isMobile(context)        // < 600px
AppStyles.isTablet(context)        // 600-900px
AppStyles.isDesktop(context)       // 900-1200px
AppStyles.isLargeDesktop(context)  // > 1200px

// Auto-adaptive values
AppStyles.getAdaptivePadding(context)  // Returns 16 or 20
AppStyles.getGridColumns(context)       // Returns 2, 3, or 4
```

**Example Usage:**
```dart
Container(
  padding: EdgeInsets.all(AppStyles.spacingMedium),
  decoration: AppStyles.containerDecoration(
    context,
    level: ContainerLevel.level1,
    borderRadius: AppStyles.radiusCard,
  ),
  child: Row(
    children: [
      Container(
        width: AppStyles.barWidth,
        height: AppStyles.barHeight,
        decoration: BoxDecoration(
          color: colorScheme.primary,
          borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(AppStyles.barRadius),
        ),
      ),
      SizedBox(width: AppStyles.spacingDefault),
      // ... content
    ],
  ),
)
```

**Why use AppStyles:**
- ✅ Change spacing/sizes in one place
- ✅ Consistent across entire app
- ✅ Easy to maintain and update
- ✅ No magic numbers in code

**Colors still use `colorScheme`:**
```dart
// Use colorScheme directly for colors
color: colorScheme.primary
color: colorScheme.onSurface
color: colorScheme.surfaceContainer
// See Container Hierarchy section for surface colors
```

