## 🚫 Anti-Patterns (DON'T DO THIS)

### ❌ Creating Custom Cards
```dart
// ❌ BAD
Container(
  decoration: BoxDecoration(...),
  child: /* Custom card */,
)

// ✅ GOOD - Use library widgets
InfoCard(/* props */)
IconListCard(/* props */)
StatCard(/* props */)
```

### ❌ Using showDialog
```dart
// ❌ BAD
showDialog(...)

// ✅ GOOD
AppBottomSheet.show(...)
```

### ❌ Using Material Icons or Legacy SvgIcons
```dart
// ❌ BAD - Material Icons
Icon(Icons.home)

// ❌ BAD - Legacy SvgIcons (deprecated)
SvgIcons.home(size: 24)

// ✅ GOOD - Font Awesome
FaIcon(FontAwesomeIcons.house, size: 24, color: colorScheme.primary)
```

### ❌ Using FABs
```dart
// ❌ BAD - FABs are forbidden
floatingActionButton: FloatingActionButton(...)

// ✅ GOOD - Actions in header
AppPremiumHeader(
  actions: [IconButton(...)],
)
```

### ❌ Hardcoding Colors
```dart
// ❌ BAD
color: Color(0xFF2196F3)
color: Colors.blue

// ✅ GOOD
color: colorScheme.primary
```

### ❌ Creating Custom Loaders
```dart
// ❌ BAD
CircularProgressIndicator()

// ✅ GOOD
import 'package:learn/core/widgets/app_loader.dart';
AppLoader()
```

