## 📚 Widget Quick Reference

### "I need to display..."

**...a card:**
→ `InfoCard`, `IconListCard`, `StatCard` (see `docs/WIDGET_LIBRARY.md`)

**...a modal/sheet:**
→ `AppBottomSheet` (ALWAYS)

**...a page header:**
→ `AppPremiumHeader` (ALWAYS)

**...a search bar:**
→ `AppSearchBar`

**...a loading indicator:**
→ `AppLoader`

**...an empty state:**
→ `EmptyState`

**...an error message:**
→ `AppErrorDisplay`

**...a button:**
→ `AppButton`, `ActionButton`

**...a list item:**
→ `IconListCard`, `ListItem`

**See full guide:** `docs/WIDGET_LIBRARY.md`

