## ✅ Before Creating Any UI - Checklist

- [ ] Read branding rules (`.cursor/rules/branding_rules.mdc`)
- [ ] Checked widget library (`docs/WIDGET_LIBRARY.md`)
- [ ] Searched for existing widget that fits the need
- [ ] Tried adapting existing widget with different props
- [ ] Using Font Awesome icons (never Material Icons or legacy SvgIcons)
- [ ] Using `colorScheme` colors (no hardcoded colors)
- [ ] Using theme text styles (no hardcoded sizes)
- [ ] Using `AppBottomSheet` for modals (never `showDialog`)
- [ ] Using `AppPremiumHeader` for headers (never `AppBar`)
- [ ] Wrapped content in `ResponsiveContainer` for web/desktop support
- [ ] Tested on different screen sizes (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- [ ] Confirmed no existing widget can handle this use case

**Only create new widgets if ALL checks pass.**

