## 🎨 Animation Guidelines

### When to Animate

✅ **DO animate:**
- Featured cards (flowing borders)
- Success states (shimmer)
- New content appearing (fade in)
- User feedback (tap responses)

❌ **DON'T animate:**
- Every list item
- Regular cards
- Static content
- Loading states (use progress indicators)

### Standard Animations

```dart
// Fade in + slide (for new items)
.animate()
.fadeIn(duration: 300.ms)
.slideX(begin: 0.1, end: 0, duration: 300.ms)

// Success shimmer
.animate(target: isCompleted ? 1 : 0)
.shimmer(
  duration: 2.seconds,
  color: colorScheme.tertiary.withOpacity(0.4),
)
```

